WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.860
This is not a conspiracy theory. This is not speculation. This is documented fact.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.560
For years, they told us Trump was the threat to democracy, but the real threat was the attempt to

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:20.420
remove him. On December 9, 2016, inside the Obama White House, a classified meeting took place.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:28.940
Present were CIA Director John Brennan, DNI James Clapper, FBI Deputy Director Andrew McCabe,

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:35.780
and several senior officials. Barack Obama was there, and what they discussed would become the

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:42.680
most coordinated political deception in U.S. history. Just days earlier, an internal intelligence

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:47.240
community report concluded Russia had not altered the outcome of the 26th election.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:54.120
On December 7, DNI Clapper reaffirmed it. Quote, foreign adversaries did not use cyberattacks on

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:59.260
critical infrastructure to alter the U.S. presidential election outcome, end quote.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:04.700
But that wasn't the story the Obama administration wanted. So after that White House meeting,

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:10.880
Clapper's executive assistant sent out an email, the order, prepare a new intelligence assessment,

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:17.500
one that aligned with the president's request. That's right. Intelligence was politicized at

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:23.400
the highest levels under the direction of a sitting president to frame the incoming one.

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:30.080
They buried prior reports, they inflated the Steele dossier, they reversed conclusions,

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:35.460
and they launched the January 6, 2017 Intelligence Community Assessment,

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:42.920
used to trigger investigations, media hysteria, FISA warrants, and ultimately, impeachment.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.320
It was a soft coup.

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:51.880
Director of National Intelligence Tulsi Gabbard has now declassified the emails, memos, and reports.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:02:01.380
In her words, this was a treasonous conspiracy orchestrated by Barack Obama and carried out by key members of his administration.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:07.020
General Flynn calls it the greatest crime in American history.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:16.060
Others are demanding arrests, indictments, and immediate action from the DOJ, because if this stands, our constitutional republic falls.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:25.680
We now have names. We have documents. We have sworn testimony. No more theories. Only accountability.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:34.500
My friends, we are all anonymous. And we speak for the silence. And we are awake. And we are everywhere.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:39.120
And we will not stop until the truth is reckoned with.
